Catalyst detection beyond the ticker feed (discovery funnel stage 7): once a day, find the 8-Ks that carry a watched item (1.01 agreements, 2.02 results, 5.02 officers, 8.01 other events) on any name of the reference universe, so a name outside coverage can come to the pipeline's notice on a filing. For each user, once ever per filing:
a name already in coverage goes to the stage 4 event review ( then : the same event row, re-score and remove rules the hourly filing watch uses);
a name that left coverage is skipped unless the filing is newer than its removal ();
any other name is nominated into the existing candidate path ( with the Scan source and a nomination reason), at most a run. It enters coverage only if the stage 1 rules () then agree: this class adds no member and no rule.
Every handled filing is recorded as a . No model is called anywhere.

