Append-only record of one coverage add or remove and the rule that fired (, a stable id from
). Nothing updates or deletes a row, so "why is / was this name covered" always
has an answer.

One news item or Radar signal near a notable move. News carries  (its source article);
a signal carries  and has no URL, it lives in the dossier's Radar section.
 is the tie-break after time proximity (higher is better).

