Rounding for per-unit prices (last close, rebased benchmark, average cost). Money amounts round to cents;
a price keeps at least four decimals and gains one per leading zero below 1, so a sub-cent crypto quote
(0.000012) keeps its significant digits instead of rounding to zero.

The look-back a  measures. Calendar windows end at the
latest priced event and start at the latest priced event on or before the window start;
 starts at the subject's first priced event.

Page-kind news source for the TrendForce press center (feature 030, R2) — the DRAM/memory
thesis feed Denys's channels cite that has no RSS. Scrapes the article list with AngleSharp;
structural assertions throw  on markup drift (FR-009).

